      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7;">
        We're not a generic agency. We're a focused team that cares about shipping products that actually work.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-num">01</div>
        <div>
          <div class="why-title">Built Around Your Business</div>
          <div class="why-desc">We don't force your business into a template. Every product we build is designed around your actual workflows, users, and goals.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-num">02</div>
        <div>
          <div class="why-title">Transparent Development</div>
          <div class="why-desc">Track milestones, review progress, and communicate with our team in real-time. You're never left wondering what's happening.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-num">03</div>
        <div>
          <div class="why-title">Scalable Architecture</div>
          <div class="why-desc">We build with future growth, security, and maintainability in mind. Your product won't need a full rewrite in two years.</div>
        </div>
